.com/en/pope-leo-xiv-calls-to-protect-migrants-during-his-official-visit-to-france--9c48e03c2ca2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/pope-leo-xiv-calls-to-protect-migrants-during-his-official-visit-to-france" /><summary type="html">Father Philip Larrey and Father Michael Baggott are on France 24.</summary></entry><entry><title>At least 16 people killed as Russia and Ukraine trade deadly air strikes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:15c734acc177458cb5e7bb1499898102e1329e43ab46e0ce3c40d7ee655e652c</id><updated>2026-09-26T19:17:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T15:40:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260926-at-least-16-people-killed-as-russia-and-ukraine-trade-deadly-air-strikes--55f3b33690aa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260926-at-least-16-people-killed-as-russia-and-ukraine-trade-deadly-air-strikes" /><summary type="html">At least 16 people were killed over the past 24 hours as Russia and Ukraine traded deadly drone and missile strikes, authorities from both countries said Saturday. The UN has warned of rising civilian deaths as Kyiv and Moscow ramp up long-range strikes on critical infrastructure.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>France's baptism boom as more young people seek catholic community</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aa3981cb67aa0b2913e36b559bdabdffc929ec21325578c2d5188d940a88bd14</id><updated>2026-09-26T19:17:06Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T15:31:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france-s-baptism-boom-as-more-young-people-seek-catholic-community--c25522907585.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france-s-baptism-boom-as-more-young-people-seek-catholic-community" /><summary type="html">Charlotte Lam has more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Leo XIV in France: 700,000 crowd attend Pope mass in central Paris</title><i